window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Sage Poe's life is about to take a terrifying turn.</b></p> <p>When a series of gruesome murders rocks the abandoned Rosehill Asylum, Sage finds herself at the center of a chilling investigation. With bodies piling up and dark secrets threatening to surface, she must use her wit and magical abilities to unravel the asylum's haunting past.</p> <p>As Sage delves deeper into the mystery, she uncovers a twisted web of cult rituals and a killer who will stop at nothing to keep the asylum's darkest secrets buried. With her sisters Lovage and Angelica by her side, Sage must navigate the suspicions of the local sheriff, the mysterious newcomer Ophelia Graves, and the charismatic developer Damien Cartwright, all while trying to keep her Aunt Hecate's magical dementia from spiraling out of control.</p> <p>But when Sage's investigation puts her in the killer's crosshairs, she must race against time to uncover the truth before she becomes the next victim. Can Sage stop the killer and lay the asylum's ghosts to rest, or will the darkness consume her and all of Bone Gap?</p>"; 
